OL,3,GNEWSABusiness park to be built on edge
OL,4,Aof town
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new business park on the
OL,7,Fedge of Shepshed have been approved.
OL,9,FThe 14-unit commercial and industrial
OL,10,Fsite was given the go-ahead for land
OL,11,Fwest of Ingleberry Road and south of
OL,12,FAshby Road in Shepshed by Charnwood
OL,13,FBorough Council on Thursday.
OL,15,FShepshed councillor David Northage told
OL,16,Fthe plans committee meeting that the K
OL,17,FM Beesley Construction Services scheme
OL,18,Fwould bring "much-needed" investment to
OL,19,Fthe town.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
