OL,3,GNEWSABusiness park to be built on edge
OL,4,Aof town
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Robin Popley said: "With the
OL,7,Fongoing expansion of our community in
OL,8,Fterms of residential development, it is
OL,9,Fimperative that we increase capacity
OL,10,Ffor business opportunities in the
OL,11,Farea."
